The sentinel is a value that is the same [[Atomic type]]

```C++
cin >> letter;
while (letter != '.'){
	
	//Do stuff
	cin >> letter;
}
```

***End of file sentinel***
`cin.eof` for data files
cin.eof() will return `true` if the buffer is at the end of the file.

```C++
sum = 0;
count = 0;
cin >> aNumber;
while (!cin.eof()){
	// Do stuff
	cin >> aNumber;
}
```
